  "name": "Airborne Lidar and digital video survey of the Bering Sea and North Pacific Ocean",
  "description": "Lidar and digital video surveys from fixed aircraft concurrent with ground survey transects to develop remote techniques for discerning epipelagic fish and associated biological structure. NOAA Fish Lidar Oceanic Experiment (FLOE) system. (532 nm)An NPMR project\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Data supporting NPMR Project \"Airborne Lidar and digital video survey of the Bering Sea and North Pacific Ocean\"",
